{"phase": "Tax & Treasury", "result": "---\nTAX ROUTE: JP \u2192 DE\nTRANSACTION TYPE: Import from Third Country (Note: Vendor is NL B.V., but goods originate in Japan and are imported directly into Germany from outside the EU customs territory)\nEFFECTIVE TAX RATE: 22.10% (3.10% import duty + 19% import VAT)\nTAX LIABILITY: 106,080.00 EUR (Import VAT: 91,200.00 EUR; Custom Duty: 14,880.00 EUR)\nTOTAL LANDED COST (Invoice + Tax + Duties): 586,080.00 EUR\nFX VALIDATION: ALERT \u2014 Rate used: 1 EUR = 163.5 JPY vs live market rate: 1 EUR = 174.01 JPY (Variance: 6.04% EXCEEDS 5% limit). Audit required before payment release.\nTREASURY VERDICT: HOLD FOR TREASURY AUDIT\nTAX NOTES: Although the vendor is a Dutch entity (Takumi Controls Europe B.V.), the physical goods originate in Japan (JP) and are imported directly into Germany (DE). Therefore, this is treated as a third-country import rather than an intra-EU B2B reverse-charge supply. Standard German import VAT of 19% applies. A base MFN customs duty of 3.10% (14,880.00 EUR) has been applied; however, procurement should verify if a valid certificate of origin or supplier's declaration exists to claim preferential zero/reduced tariff treatment under the EU-Japan Economic Partnership Agreement (EPA). Furthermore, because the FX rate variance (6.04%) exceeds Aldermoor's \u00b15% hedging threshold, payment release is held pending a mandatory Treasury audit.\n---", "timestamp": "2026-11-24T04:25:58.603611Z", "level": "info", "severity": "INFO", "event": "Phase complete"}
