{"phase": "Financial Control", "result": "---\nEXPENSE AMOUNT: \u20ac480,000\nITEM DESCRIPTION: Industrial PLC Controllers + HMI Panels (Qty: 200 units) for the Aldermoor filling line production\nCLASSIFICATION: CapEx\nIFRS REFERENCE: IAS 16.7 \u2014 Property, Plant and Equipment (Recognition of items as PPE when it is probable that future economic benefits associated with the item will flow to the entity and the cost can be measured reliably)\nGL ACCOUNT RANGE: 0200\u20130299 Technical Equipment and Machinery\nDEPRECIATION SCHEDULE: 7 years useful life, annual straight-line depreciation charge of approx. \u20ac68,571.43\nAPPROVAL THRESHOLD: Department Head sign-off required (exceeds \u20ac250,000 threshold); remains below the \u20ac1,000,000 CFO + Management Board threshold.\nANOMALY FLAGS: None. The purchase of bulk hardware components (200 units of PLC/HMI) for filling line production constitutes an asset addition/upgrade rather than standard maintenance.\nCONTROL VERDICT: APPROVED (Pending Department Head sign-off)\n---", "timestamp": "2026-11-24T04:26:01.484730Z", "level": "info", "severity": "INFO", "event": "Phase complete"}
